<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - Hoogovens results by product group.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Hoogovens results by product group.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERWIJK, Netherlands 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997.</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit by product group in millions of guilders:</p>
<p>    Steel					     275  vs  193</p>
<p>    Aluminium					  38  vs   25</p>
<p>    Technical services		     loss   4  vs    0</p>
<p>    Other activities			 loss  40  vs    7 loss</p>
<p>    Total					     269  vs  211</p>
<p>Turnover by product group, in billions of guilders unless otherwise stated:</p>
<p>    Steel					    3.092 vs 2.549</p>
<p>    Aluminium					1.379 vs 1.111</p>
<p>    Technical services (millions)		    42  vs   98</p>
<p>    Other (millions)				    nil  vs   25</p>
<p>Less:</p>
<p>    Intercompany deliveries (millions)	     18  vs    8</p>
<p>    Total					    4.495 vs 3.773</p>
